<td style="vertical-align:bottom"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#toc57395_16">APPENDIX A RECONCILIATION OF <span style="white-space:nowrap">NON-GAAP</span> FINANCIAL MEASURES</a></p></td>
