<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(3)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">The dollar amounts reported in column (d)&#160;represent the average of the amounts reported for our <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Non-PEO</div> NEOs as a group in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table in each applicable year. The <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Non-PEO</div> NEOs included for purposes of calculating the average amounts in each applicable year are Mr.&#160;Stewart and Ms.&#160;Golzadeh. </div></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_163007872" id="ixv-5793">
