Revocable Trust; (ii) 1,136,725 shares of common stock held by Lauder Partners LLC; (iii) 91,000 shares of common stock held by Gary M. Lauder 2015 Trust; and (iv) 8,152 shares of common stock held directly by Mr.&#160;Lauder. Mr.&#160;Lauder is a Trustee of The Gary M. Lauder Revocable Trust and Gary M. Lauder 2015 Trust and the General Partner of Lauder Partners LLC and has sole voting and dispositive power over the 2,255,406 shares. The address of The Gary M. Lauder Revocable Trust and Lauder Partners LLC is 40th Floor, 767 Fifth Ave., New York, NY 10153. </td></tr></table>
