<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Consists of: (i) 10,966 shares of common stock held directly by Ms.&#160;Grant; and (ii) 17,674 shares of common stock issuable pursuant to RSUs vesting within 60 days of April&#160;9, 2026. Ms.&#160;Grant has elected to defer the settlement of these RSUs until the earlier of a &#8220;change in control&#8221; as defined in the 2017 Plan, or within 60 days following her &#8220;separation date&#8221; (as defined under the deferral election). </p></td></tr></table>
